N5008 [meta.rel] is_base_of, [class.derived.general]/2: a base class may be
indirect.  __is_base_of(input_iterator_tag, random_access_iterator_tag) and
std::is_base_of over a three-level chain were false (direct bases only), so
derived_from<ITER_CONCEPT(I), input_iterator_tag> failed for every
random-access iterator.
